## Success Metrics
- **Latency**: P99 update-to-dashboard < 500ms
- **Privacy**: Formal (ε, δ)-differential privacy guarantee
- **Accuracy**: Reconstruction error within 5% of centralized PCA
- **Drift**: Alert within 30 seconds of covariate shift onset
- **Fairness**: Cross-tenant variance in explained variance < 10%

## Why This Is Asked

Gauges a candidate's ability to design streaming, scalable PCA with missing data and drift in production environments.

## Key Concepts

- Incremental PCA / SVD, sliding window approaches
- Online imputation for missing data, streaming normalization
- Drift detection in loadings and explained variance
